":[],"npcId":[30055],"performCfg":"","priority":5,"questId":72654,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":726540101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"Muzhen","textMapHash":24704858,"text":"Thanks to the clues you brought back, I'm now able to pinpoint the location of the Ruin machines.","nextNodeIds":[726540102]},{"nodeId":726540102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"Muzhen","textMapHash":186158322,"text":"However, we need to take care of a little problem before we do that...","nextNodeIds":[726540103]},{"nodeId":726540103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"Muzhen","textMapHash":2228087362,"text":"There are some Electro anomalies nearby that are interfering with the tracking process. I'll give you the locations of these anomalies... Please, get rid of them.","nextNodeIds":[726540104]},{"nodeId":726540104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"Muzhen","textMapHash":534936978,"text":"Just as before, I'll need you to bring some samples back... Firstly, to study how I might use them.","nextNodeIds":[726540105]},{"nodeId":726540105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"Muzhen","textMapHash":710410442,"text":"And secondly... well, we are a merchant fleet, after all. We've got to see if they've got any commercial worth, of course!","nextNodeIds":[726540106]},{"nodeId":726540106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":725505066,"text":"And how are your studies going on that front?","nextNodeIds":[726540107]},{"nodeId":726540107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"Muzhen","textMapHash":608466890,"text":"Hmm... The samples that you've given me, if properly used, might give The Crux Fleet a new way of dodging thunderstorms with ease that doesn't rely on our mobility.","nextNodeIds":[726540108]},{"nodeId":726540108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"Muzhen","textMapHash":3061058082,"text":"If so, it would make our commercial route to and from Inazuma much more secure, and we would have more guaranteed efficiency.","nextNodeIds":[726540109]},{"nodeId":726540109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"Muzhen","textMapHash":1497598138,"text":"However, seeing as the Sakoku Decree is the Shogun's will, such actions may displease her...","nextNodeIds":[726540110]},{"nodeId":726540110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"Muzhen","textMapHash":64421610,"text":"So of course, the most direct result of our research is that we can use the \"age\" and \"life\" of these anomalous Electro growths to determine the size and origin of Electro anomalies.","nextNodeIds":[726540111]},{"nodeId":726540111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"Muzhen","textMapHash":241665090,"text":"These origins, of course, are the targets we're looking for: the ancient, mysterious Ruin organisms!","nextNodeIds":[726540112]},{"nodeId":726540112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"Muzhen","textMapHash":2010953042,"text":"Hehe, sorry, got a little carried away there...","nextNodeIds":[726540113]},{"nodeId":726540113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"Muzhen","textMapHash":3112317970,"text":"Well then. This is the final stretch. Let's get going!","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7265401,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30055"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":